letter.body:
To the CEO of {{corpName}},

The Bureau confirms receipt of 400 units of silicates against Requisition Order 4-7A. Payment of 12,000 credits has been released.

The Charter Round review looks at three things: production, delivery and trade. You have shown the first two. Sell what you do not need on the Galactic Exchange.

{{speaker.name}}
{{speaker.title}}

To the CEO of {{corpName}},

The Contracting & Assignments Bureau has filed your corporation's confirmation under the 2147 Charter Round. Your charter is no longer probationary.

The Bureau's next requisitions post on the schedule shown in your Assignments tab. Your next corporate milestones are on your Overview.

{{speaker.name}}
{{speaker.title}}
